  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingPresentationOfAccumulatedImpairmentLossTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">　上記減価償却累計額には、有形固定資産の減損損失累計額が含まれております。</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingPresentationOfAccumulatedImpairmentLossTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingPledgedAssetsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">
